:"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I was testing ES6 with Babel when I ran into the following problem:\n\n``` javascript\nfunction jello(fn) {\n  fn();\n}\nclass Hey {\n  constructor() {\n    this.name = \"John\";\n  }\n  sayHello(partingMessage) {\n    jello(() => console.log(`Hello, ${this.name}!`));\n    console.log(partingMessage);\n  }\n}\nvar h = new Hey();\nh.sayHello();\n```\n\nI get this warning:\n\n  4:6  error  Hey is defined but never used  no-unused-vars\n\n✖ 1 problem (1 error, 0 warnings)\n\nAlso, should h.sayHello produce a warning since it's calling it without an argument? Is there an option for that one? :-)\n\nApparently Espree got a related fix and I also checked out a couple of related bugs. But I couldn't see a code like mine in the samples for the error. Most of them were worried about module exporting instead.\n\nThanks.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel-eslint/issues/39/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/babel/babel-eslint/issues/39/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":248178283,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDI0ODE3ODI4Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/events/248178283","actor":{"login":"nzakas","id":38546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas","html_url":"https://github.com/nzakas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzaka